  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combating Child Labor Through Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduce exploitative child labor in sugarcane growing areas through the provision of direct educational services and sustainable livelihood services; supporting national institutions to improve policies, programs, and delivery of education, social protection, and sustainable livelihood services; raising awareness and ensuring long-term sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
